{"id":"n70500-1-8","stage":5,"title":"어리둥절하다 · 不知所措","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70500-1-8-1","ko":"언제까지 그렇게 어리둥절해 있을 겁니까?","zh":"您还要困惑到什么时候呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언제까지","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어리둥절해","meaning":"不知所措，糊涂，愣","explanation":"어리둥절하다：不知所措，糊涂，愣；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"어리둥절하다","audio":"/audio/77861f3eae1a5b4074fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70500","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리둥절하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"겁니까?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"77861f3eae1a5b40","term":"어리둥절하다","zh":"不知所措，糊涂，愣","audio":"/audio/77861f3eae1a5b4074fe.mp3","entryId":"70500","definition":"不清楚事情的状况而晕头晕脑。","pronunciation":["어리둥절하다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/191da212e25e6f16a551.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70500-1-8-2","ko":"그러니까 어떻게 된 상황인지 설명을 해 주셔야지요.","zh":"所以您得把现在的状况解释清楚啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러니까","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그러니까：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그러니까","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58609","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러니까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"된","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상황인지","meaning":"状况，情况","explanation":"상황：状况，情况；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"상황","audio":"/audio/946f8147acaaf499e924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16582","senseId":"1","lemma":"상황","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"설명을","meaning":"说明","explanation":"설명：说明；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"설명","audio":"/audio/8c3f651d3083e63da644.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65116","senseId":"1","lemma":"설명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주셔야지요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어야지요：礼貌地表示应当、必要或决心；也可随语境构成反问。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f064d1058a27cd38","term":"그러니까","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/f064d1058a27cd3851f3.mp3","entryId":"58609","definition":"因为那个原因；或因为那样的缘故。","pronunciation":["그러니까"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"946f8147acaaf499","term":"상황","zh":"状况，情况","audio":"/audio/946f8147acaaf499e924.mp3","entryId":"16582","definition":"事情进行的景况或态势。","pronunciation":["상황"]},{"id":"8c3f651d3083e63d","term":"설명","zh":"说明","audio":"/audio/8c3f651d3083e63da644.mp3","entryId":"65116","definition":"向他人简单易懂地解释；或指那样的言语。","pronunciation":["설명"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ae74700cf50c3dd71e61.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.565,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70500","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":172,"sequenceScore":3.3917,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["您还要困惑到什么时候呢？","所以您得把现在的状况解释清楚啊。","校长先生，祝您退休快乐！"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您还要困惑到什么时候呢？","所以您得把现在的状况解释清楚啊。","校长先生，祝您退休快乐！"],"answer":1}]}
